      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHITE CAR (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, half a length from the winner Canya Gold (29.11) at this track. Can measure up this time. DONE BY NOON (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 21.93 beating Mishawaka. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Sure to be thereabouts. KRAMER (8) goes very well here starting eight times for three wins and four minors. Recorded a 3.5 lengths win (21.86) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. SHE'S SAINTLY (4) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
